    },
    "Not Now" : {

    },
    "Not available at this text size in this window: the keyboard would cover Emergency, Yes, No and Get Attention." : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver hint on Home's Type while it is dimmed, because the window has no room for the safety buttons above the keyboard."
    },
    "Nothing to turn on. If tapping is hard, Touch Accommodations can help: Hold Duration ignores touches shorter than a set time, Ignore Repeat treats several quick touches as one, and Tap Assistance uses the first or last place touched." : {

    },
    "On an iPhone with an Action button, pressing and holding it can use an accessibility feature or run a shortcut." : {

    },
    "On iPad, an eye-tracking device made for iPad can move the pointer instead of the camera. Apple describes this for iPad, not iPhone." : {

    },
    "On the Apple Watch, open Settings > Accessibility > Live Speech and turn it on." : {

    },
    "On the same screen, save phrases used often under Phrases." : {

    },
    "Open %@, then triple-click the side or top button (the Home button, on a model that has one) and choose Start." : {

